\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The HACOF{} lifecycle. Steps 1--3 (blue) prevent; only step 3, the in-path gate (red border), can stop an action before it executes. Steps 4--7 (amber) detect and contain actions already under way. Steps 8--9 (green) recover and feed approved changes back to step 1. The audit plane records every step, and people decide the exceptions routed to them.}}{16}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lifecycle}{{3}{16}{The \hacof {} lifecycle. Steps 1--3 (blue) prevent; only step 3, the in-path gate (red border), can stop an action before it executes. Steps 4--7 (amber) detect and contain actions already under way. Steps 8--9 (green) recover and feed approved changes back to step 1. The audit plane records every step, and people decide the exceptions routed to them}{figure.3}{}}
